<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets A$100 mln seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets A$100 mln seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EKSPORTFINANS ASA</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    07.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.65    PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/AU/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
